ction-homepage-faq","blocks":{"faq_1":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How long does UK delivery take?","answer":"Since we are a small studio practicing sustainable small-batch restocking, our delivery time is usually 7-12 business days. We promise it's worth the wait! You can track your order every step of the way."}},"faq_2":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Will it tarnish or turn green?","answer":"Never. We use high-quality Stainless Steel with 18K Gold PVD plating. This is far more durable than traditional gold plating. No green necks, no fading?uaranteed."}},"faq_3":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I wear it in the shower?","answer":"Yes, go ahead! Our jewelry is designed for real life. It is waterproof, sweatproof, and perfume-safe. Wear it in the shower, the gym, or the ocean without worry."}},"faq_4":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Does it come in a gift box?","answer":"Yes. Every piece is packed in our eco-friendly luxury box and a soft pouch. We don't include price tags in the package, so it's perfectly safe to send directly to your special someone."}},"faq_5":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I add a personal message?","answer":"Absolutely! We believe in the personal touch. Just leave your note at checkout, and we will hand-write your message on a premium gift card for free."}},"faq_6":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What if she doesn't like it?","answer":"We offer a 14-day return policy. If the piece isn't quite right, simply contact us within 14 days of receiving it for a hassle-free return or exchange."}}},"block_order":["faq_1","faq_2","faq_3","faq_4","faq_5","faq_6"],"settings":{"preheading":"Questions?","heading":"We've Got Answers"}}},"order":["hero_main","trust_bar","product_list","gift_anatomy","testimonials","homepage_faq"]}
